    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's still stinging really bad... i don't really want to go to the ER if i don't have to, it's so expensive. i have those herbal drops right here, they're supposed to be all natural and soothing for inflammation. wouldn't those be safer than just rinsing with tap water? like, wouldn't they coat the eye and help it feel better faster?",
